   963	/**
   964	 * Reverse a merge: split a tombstoned loser (`entity_id`) back out of the winner
   965	 * it was folded into. The winner is recovered from the loser's own `merged_into`
   966	 * pointer (not passed in). Admin/owner only, org-fenced. Exact ledger restoration
   967	 * and the legacy marker fallback live in `applyUnmerge`; this handler is the gate
   968	 * + validation.
